OL,5,G0000 Sean Connery Vs James Bond
OL,6,     FExplore the eclectic career of
OL,7,     FSean Connery, who, having become a
OL,8,     Fstar thanks to James Bond, never
OL,9,     Fstopped trying to shed the image
OL,10,     Fof a sexy, brutal macho that stuck
OL,11,     Fto 007.
OL,12,G0115 Discovering Romance On Film
OL,13,     FFilm critics Ian Nathan, Bonnie
OL,14,     FGreer, Neil Norman and Stephen
OL,15,     FArmstrong discuss their favourite
OL,16,     Fromance movies of all time,
OL,17,     Fincluding Casablanca and When
OL,18,     FHarry Met Sally.
